/**
 * VALET Agent — Brand operations, campaign orchestration, contract deployment.
 *
 * PRD Workflow A:
 * 1. Brand authenticates via did:web (stub: domain + wallet sig → JWT)
 * 2. VALET verifies X.402 VCs (stub: server-issued JWT, V2: real VC chain)
 * 3. Brand configures campaign (product details, inventory, affiliate rate)
 * 4. VALET deploys PVTToken + IMPXMarket on Base Sepolia
 * 5. VALET pushes assets to ICP canister (stub: local store)
 * 6. VALET deposits secret codes into Swiss Subnet vault (stub: AES-256 local)
 * 7. Gas: accrued from brand revenue payout (stub: brand pre-funds deployer)
 */
